<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cyrix downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cyrix downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Cyrix Corp shares and removed the company from its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Shares now rated market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-3/8 to 20-3/8.</p>
</text>
